name: ['Artisan of Kozilek', 'Contagion Clasp', 'Cultivate', 'Everflowing Chalice', 'Go for the Throat', "Jace's Ingenuity", 'Rhox War Monk', 'Savage Lands', 'Spellstutter Sprite', 'Squadron Hawk', 'Teetering Peaks', 'Wall of Omens']
